gTK(){return"Yes. The sign indicates a gas station."},
gTN(){return"Does this sign give you priority when leaving the gas station on the road?"},
gTM(){return"No. When leaving the adjacent territory, you must yield to road users (clause 8.3)."},
gTT(){return"Does the sign show the distance to the place where a restriction begins?"},
